    ],
    "text": "2.The Economic Service Charge Act, No. 13 of 2006(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in section 2, by the substitution for paragraph (a)and (b) of subsecion (2) thereof, of the following:\u2014",
